      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:uq5d6c'
    '|a||Spotting the failure is the easy half. Every arrow from failure to remedy has to be drawn by someone real.':
