      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:1a1as7m'
    '|a||Big failure, decent fixer: step in. Fixer worse than the failure: the cure is worse than the disease.':
      mp3: 
