      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:3vecyp'
    '|b||And a state fails in two ways. It may know too little: the right size of a carbon tax, what a tonne of smoke really costs.':
