      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:1se6u88'
    '|a||Or it may want the wrong thing: voters too busy to watch, dentists sitting on the dentists'' board.':
