      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:97u2p6'
    '|b||Now the block''s cases. London''s congestion charge: a real jam, and a charge that cut delays.':
